      "message": "This flag is only for PWR_STATE_IDLE. If you will see board/lazor/led.c (ln. 109) , in PWR_STATE_IDLE, it looks for chflags to decide the color. Since it is only applicable to this particular state, does it make sense to remove this property and directly look up the enum pwr_state for this condition. See its use in current review led.c file",
