      "writtenOn": "2021-10-05T21:58:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see. A better way to model it is to introduce a new `charge_flags` property. It is not required.\n\nThe dts nodes are like:\n    power-state-idle-forced {\n        charge-state \u003d \"IDLE\";\n        charge-flag \u003d \u003cCHARGE_FLAG_FORCE_IDLE\u003e;\n        /* Blue 2 sec, Amber 2 sec */\n    }\n    power-state-idle-default {\n        charge-state \u003d \"IDLE\";\n        charge-flag \u003d \u003c0\u003e;\n        /* Solid Blue */\n    }",
