      "writtenOn": "2021-10-06T18:29:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This confuses people. People don\u0027t know this PWR_STATE_IDLE special case that requires the extra color-3. It also limits the usage that the if condition has 2 colors and the else one has 1 color. How about the if condition has 1 color and the else one has 2 colors?\n\nI understand the waste of introducing one more dimension. How about an extra dimensions which supports any of this rare feature? like an extra-flag property. The CHARGE_FLAG_FORCE_IDLE is one of the flag. More future flags can be added if needed.\n\n    power-state-idle-forced {\n        charge-state \u003d \"IDLE\";\n        extra-flag \u003d \"CHARGE_FLAG_FORCE_IDLE_SET\";\n        /* Blue 2 sec, Amber 2 sec */\n    }\n    power-state-idle-default {\n        charge-state \u003d \"IDLE\";\n        extra-flag \u003d \"CHARGE_FLAG_FORCE_IDLE_CLEAR\";\n        /* Solid Blue */\n    }",
